 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "For the Rest of My Life"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "余生为期"
   },
   {
    "zh-ro": "Yu Sheng Wei Qi"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "She fell in love with an older woman when she was a child, but was never taken seriously. Years later, now both adults, they met again and started living together by chance. She discovered that the woman was a famous book editor, but also had a painful past and a wounded heart. She decided to protect and heal her with her pure and sincere love.\n\nBut, they faced many obstacles and prejudices because of age and gender differences. Could they overcome the difficulties and stay together forever? This is a love story between an innocent young girl and a mature woman, who found each other and lost each other in life, but never gave up on loving each other."
  },
